        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.hallmarkchannel.com/a-keller-christmas-vacation",
          "overview": "The Keller family, including the parents and their three adult children, decide to take a European river cruise touring the Christmas Markets over the holidays, and each sibling is going through their own life challenge.",
          "runtime": 84,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BE",
        "iso_639_1": "nl",
        "name": "Nederlands",
        "english_name": "Dutch",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Het gezin Keller – de ouders en hun drie volwassen kinderen – besluit de feestdagen door te brengen op een Europese riviercruise langs sfeervolle kerstmarkten. Terwijl de lichtjes schitteren op het water en de geur van glühwein de lucht vult, blijkt dat ieder kind zijn eigen strijd voert – en dat deze reis misschien wel meer zal onthullen dan ze hadden verwacht.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BR",
        "iso_639_1": "pt",
        "name": "Português",
        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "A história acompanha os pais Anne e Ben, que decidem presentear os três filhos adultos com um cruzeiro fluvial de Natal pelo rio Danúbio.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "O Natal da Família Keller"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "IT",
        "iso_639_1": "it",
        "name": "Italiano",
        "english_name": "Italian",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "La famiglia Keller, composta dai genitori e dai loro tre figli adulti, decide di fare una crociera fluviale in Europa per visitare i mercatini di Natale durante le vacanze, e ogni fratello sta affrontando le proprie sfide di vita.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "今年的圣诞节对于凯勒一家来说将会有些不同，因为父母安妮和本为他们的三个成年子女——长子卡尔、中子迪伦和女儿埃默里——预订了一次沿多瑙河而下、从德国穿过萨尔茨堡到维也纳的游船之旅，沿途他们将参观美丽的欧洲圣诞市场和城镇。然而兄妹三人禀性迥异，各有人生困顿，年来疏阔已久。闻得十日同舟共济，皆暗暗叫苦。但他们还是说“好”，因为这就是一家人该做的。岂料此番舟行，竟成毕生难逢的辉煌之旅：错过的缘分与新知交织，山川胜景迭出；情海波澜间萌发爱情，甲板游戏使得天伦欢聚。更有一桩秘辛，终在圣诞钟鸣前，教离散之心重聚。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "凯勒家的圣诞假期"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "La famille Keller embarque pour une croisière de Noël sur le Danube, entre l'Allemagne et l'Autriche. Mais derrière les fêtes et les paysages féériques, chacun traverse une période de doute : rupture, amour manqué ou avenir professionnel incertain. Au fil des escales et des imprévus, cette aventure familiale pourrait bien changer leur vie et leur réserver un Noël inoubliable...",
          "runtime": 84,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Tous à bord pour Noël !"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "DK",
        "iso_639_1": "da",
        "name": "Dansk",
        "english_name": "Danish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Familien Keller – forældrene og deres tre voksne børn – beslutter sig for at tage på et flodkrydstogt i Europa for at besøge julemarkeder i løbet af højtiden, mens hvert af børnene står over for deres egne personlige udfordringer.",
          "runtime": 84,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
